cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "FDA-Approved Drug-Like Compound Library for Structure-Based Virtual Screening"
abstract: >
  A curated, drug-like filtered subset of FDA-approved compounds (DrugCentral + ChEMBL
  max_phase = 4) ready for structure-based virtual screening against any protein target.
  The library was filtered using Lipinski Rule of Five, Veber oral bioavailability
  criteria, and energy QC, yielding 2,611 PDBQT-ready compounds from an initial set of
  168,046 entries. Includes SMILES, InChIKey, ADME descriptors (MW, logP, TPSA,
  rotatable bonds, HBD/HBA), and validated 3D conformers.
